<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - LCI Int'l downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - LCI Int'l downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it lowered its recommendation on LCI International Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 3/4 to 36 in morning New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
